      "value": "Also seems to be happening with these two worlds:\nSKYLINE CAFÉ — by Chengi\nhttps://www.vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_80f20b1a-690d-4f78-8993-0513470e10ed\nand SKYLINE CAFÉ （V3․0） — by Chengi\nhttps://www.vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_1fee0d73-7e4a-4119-92bb-cf1c1c785971\nUnlike the Silent hill 2 world, though, the animations recover in under 15 seconds in both of these worlds.",
