  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This bug has been present since Avatars 3.0 was introduced.\nThis only affects Avatars 3.0 avatars.\nThe world in question: Silent hill 2 by TheSlinker \nhttps://www.vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_72bd0810-125e-4dd3-93b5-18319af132f4\n\nThis does not happen if you start the game directly to that world. You must switch to that world from another world.\nOn entering the world, only the first frame of locomotion animations plays. Crouch / Prone animations do not work at all, you just slide around standing up. Any animations you have set up as emotes in your round menu do not play.\nAfter the ~45 seconds are up, any animations you tried to run all try to go at once and the avatar functions as normal again.\nIf you switch worlds before the ~45 seconds are up, this effect carries over to the next world but does not affect the timing. It still only lasts for ~45 seconds after entering the Silent hill 2 world.",
